endering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-17T14:09:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T08:18:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124574","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124574","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124574.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124574.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #122005\n\n## Additional information\n\nThis is based on the investigation by @AxelStrem in the linked issue. The implementation of `_particles_free_data()` suggested that it would make sense to trigger `DEPENDENCY_CHANGED_PARTICLES` rather than `DEPENDENCY_CHANGED_PARTICLES_INSTANCES` in this case (userdata mismatch), and sure enough this was required  to fix this for the mobile renderer. Forward+ was fixed by triggering either notification. It seems that the mobile listener only subscribes to particles changed but forward+  also subscribes to particle instances changed, I'm not sure why. \n\nIn any case, triggering the dependency changed notification when running into this userdata mismatch fixes the particle issues I was having before, and the spammed errors are no more. Previously the geometry instance wasn't being marked as dirty after the particle buffers were freed, leading to lots of these errors: \n\n> ERROR: RenderingDevice::draw_list_bind_uniform_set: Parameter \"uniform_set\" is null.\n   at: (servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124574/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124574/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}